    "event_description": "<p data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"426\">Join us every Sunday for Family Day at Fulham Pier!&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"174\" data-end=\"426\">Enjoy a fun filled afternoon by the river with family entertainment which changes week to week, whether its face painting, magicians, storytelling, bubbles and more. There&rsquo;s always something to delight - from 12pm -5pm.</p>\n<p data-start=\"428\" data-end=\"625\">The Kids&rsquo; Table will also be popping up at Riverside Market every Sunday 12pm-4pm, keeping little hands busy with themed crafts and tabletop fun, while you relax and enjoy your meal.</p>\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"831\">Activities are free to join and offered on a first come, first served basis for dining guests. Grown-ups must stay nearby and supervise their children at all times. Suitable for ages 3 and up.</p>\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"831\"><strong><em>Please be aware that in order to keep Family Sunday accessible to all, we don't accept reservations for any activities featured.&nbsp;</em></strong><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"627\" data-end=\"831\"><em>Please note outside food and drinks cannot be consumed within Fulham Pier.</em></p>\n<p><br /></p>",
