    "event_title": "FIFA World Cup Live Screenings ",
    "event_description": "<style>\na {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n</style>\n<div>\n<div>\n<p>Experience the excitement of the <strong>FIFA World Cup</strong> at the Pier, with live screenings bringing every match to life in a vibrant, social setting.</p>\n<p>Gather with friends, family and fellow fans to cheer on your country, soak up the electric atmosphere and enjoy the thrill of the tournament as it unfolds on the big screen.</p>\n<p>With food, drinks and plenty of space to relax in Riverside Market, it&rsquo;s the perfect spot to catch all the action, whether you're a die-hard supporter or just looking to enjoy the buzz of the game.</p>\n<p><strong>Free to attend, first come first serve. We don't accept bookings.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong></strong><br /></p>\n<h4><br /><strong></strong></h4>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<div>\n<h4><strong>Quarter Finals Schedule&nbsp;</strong></h4>\n<p><strong></strong><br /></p>\n<p><strong></strong><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Thursday 9 July</strong>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>France v Morocco, 9.00pm (90 minutes only)&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Friday 10 July</strong></p>\n<p>Spain v Belgium, 8.00pm (Full Match)</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>Saturday 11 July&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p>Norway v <strong>England</strong>, 10.00pm (Full Match)&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Food served until 11.15pm and bar open until late.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><br /></p>\n</div>\n<strong></strong></div>\n<div><strong>Please note we cannot show all fixtures due to kick-off times outside of our operating hours.&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong><br /></div>\n<div><strong></strong><br /></div>\n<div><strong>Thank you for your understanding.&nbsp;</strong></div>\n<div><strong></strong><br /></div>\n<div>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><span>Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.fulhampier.com/riverside-market\">Riverside Market</a><span>, from burgers, to Lebanese, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://brasserieconstance.com/\">Brasserie Constance</a><span>, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</span></p>\n</div>\n<p><br /></p>\n<style>\na {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n</style>",
    "event_summary": "Catch every moment of the action with our World Cup screenings, bringing the excitement of live football to the pier in a vibrant, social atmosphere.",
