    "event_no": 100640,
    "repeat_frequency": "",
    "event_id": "",
    "event_title": "Wimbledon Live Screenings & Activities ",
    "event_description": "<style>\na {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n</style>\n<div>\n<p>Game, set, match! Join us at the Pier from 29th June - 12th July, for a lively celebration of The Championships at Wimbledon, where you can catch all the action courtside-style on the big screens throughout the entire tournament.</p>\n<p>Set against a relaxed family-friendly atmosphere, guests are free to drop in, soak up the matches and enjoy the day at their own pace. Whether you're a tennis fan or just looking for a fun day out by the water, there&rsquo;s something for everyone to enjoy.&nbsp;From strawberries and cream to a perfectly chilled Pimm&rsquo;s, there will be plenty to enjoy alongside our usual food and drink offering.</p>\n<p>Challenge friends and family to a game of table tennis, or get involved in our special weekend entertainment with plenty to keep the little ones entertained. Expect plenty of surprises, from playful &ldquo;linesman&rdquo; performers bringing the spirit of SW19 to life; to a bubbleologist, magician and creative craft tables and face painting to keep younger visitors entertained.</p>\n</div>\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"519\"><strong>Free to attend. First come first serve, we don't accept bookings for seating.&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"519\">Table tennis available with deposit from London Essence Bar.&nbsp;</p>\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span>Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.fulhampier.com/riverside-market\">Riverside Market</a><span>, from burgers, to&nbsp;Lebanese, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://brasserieconstance.com/\">Brasserie Constance</a><span>, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</span></p>",
    "event_summary": "Join us for game, set, match as we play all the big games on the screens around Riverside Market. ",
