    "event_title": "Dancercise with Anna Wicks",
    "event_description": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">A dance-based movement class where exercise is stripped back to its most freeing form: moving your body for the pure joy of it.</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<p data-start=\"260\" data-end=\"625\">These classes are a welcoming, judgement-free space where you&rsquo;re encouraged to lose your inhibitions and reconnect with that carefree feeling of dancing like no one is watching. Expect uplifting playlists, easy-to-follow movement, plenty of laughter, and Anna fully committing alongside you&nbsp;- from air guitars and shimmying to sweating it out with a lot of heart.</p>\n<p data-start=\"632\" data-end=\"844\">No dance experience is needed, just a willingness to move and have fun. Come along for an hour of boogying that celebrates joyful, judgement-free exercise and leaves you feeling energised, confident, and smiling.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Every Wednesday 12.30pm - 1.30pm</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Important info:</div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"ewa-rteLine\">No previous dance experience is required</li>\n<li class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Bring a water bottle (no other equipment required)</li>\n<li class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Comfortable trainers or bare feet are recommended</li>\n<li class=\"ewa-rteLine\">This class is open to all ages</li>\n<li class=\"ewa-rteLine\">Please arrive five minutes before the start of class and make your way to the Fulham Pier reception</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Variety of food available to purchase in Riverside Market before, during and after the event.</p>",
    "event_summary": "Please join us at Riverside Market for an hour of boogying with Anna Wicks",
