    "event_title": "Pier & Pour Monthly Wine Club: A Taste of the French Riviera",
    "event_description": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>This month&rsquo;s edition of </span><span><strong>Pier &amp; Pour</strong> invites you to escape to the sun-drenched shores of the <strong>French Riviera</strong> through a carefully curated evening of wine, seasonal </span><span>flavours</span><span> and relaxed conversation.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Inspired by the long lunches of Saint-Tropez, golden evenings in Nice, and the effortless elegance of Mediterranean living, this special edition celebrates the wines and flavours of summer. <strong>Expect crisp Proven&ccedil;al ros&eacute;s, refreshing whites and vibrant selections chosen to capture the spirit of the Riviera.</strong></span></span><strong><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Hosted by our Wine Ambassador, the evening will take you on a guided tasting journey with insights into each wine and the stories behind them. Seasonal snacks will be served throughout, thoughtfully paired to complement the wines and enhance the experience.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Designed for both curious newcomers and seasoned wine lovers, Pier &amp; Pour is an opportunity to discover something new, meet like-minded people</span> <span>and savour the simple pleasure of good wine in great company.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Think Riviera charm, summer ease and all the sophistication of a Mediterranean escape without the boarding pass.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Dress code: Riviera chic is warmly encouraged.</span></em><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Book your tickets now to j</span><span>oin us for a midsummer evening by the river and raise a glass to the season.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>",
    "event_summary": "This July, our Wine Club invites you to discover a carefully curated selection of wines inspired by the sun-soaked elegance of the French Riviera.",
