    "event_title": "Parent and Baby Secret Film Screenings ",
    "event_description": "<p data-start=\"139\" data-end=\"387\">At our Parent and Baby Secret Film Screenings, expect a feel-good movie experience designed especially for parents and their little sidekicks. It&rsquo;s your chance to press pause on the chaos, gather your friends and enjoy some well-deserved &ldquo;you time&rdquo;.</p>\n<p data-start=\"389\" data-end=\"613\">Here&rsquo;s the twist - the film is a surprise. We choose the movie and you simply arrive ready to enjoy a classic chick-flick favourite. Think iconic, heart-warming films that help you relax, unwind and switch off for a while.</p>\n<p data-start=\"615\" data-end=\"845\">The screening environment is created with parents and babies in mind, with soft lighting, relaxed sound levels and a supportive, judgement-free atmosphere where feeding, cuddling and the occasional wiggle are completely welcome.</p>\n<p data-start=\"847\" data-end=\"1052\">Babies must be under 12 months old and held in arms. Up to four adults may attend with one baby; adults arriving without a baby will not be admitted. Buggy space and baby-changing facilities are available.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1054\" data-end=\"1141\">Your ticket includes entry to Orange Box and popcorn.</p>\n<p data-start=\"1143\" data-end=\"1254\">A variety of food will also be available to purchase from Riverside Market before, during, and after the event.</p>",
