    "event_title": "Summer Makers Market ",
    "event_description": "<p>Soak up the sun with the return of our Makers Market&nbsp;on Saturday&nbsp;18th July.</p>\n<p>Discover a selection of handcrafted goods, with a carefully curated blend of jewellery, art, trinkets, textiles and condiments all made with love by local makers.&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Enjoy&nbsp;a lively atmosphere with live music, kids crafts and activities with plenty of spots to relax and enjoy the day.&nbsp;</p>\n<p><strong>Free to attend</strong></p>\n<p>Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.fulhampier.com/riverside-market\">Riverside Market</a>, from burgers, to Butter Chicken, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at&nbsp;<a href=\"https://brasserieconstance.com/\">Brasserie Constance</a>, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</p>",
