    "event_title": "FIFA World Cup 2026 Final",
    "event_description": "<style>\na {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n</style>\n<div>\n<p><br /></p>\n<p><strong>One night. One game. Everything on the line.</strong></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Join us </span><span>in Orange Box </span><span>for the </span></span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>FIFA World Cup 2026 Final</span></span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span> and experience football's biggest occasion in a setting </span><span>built for moments like this</span><span>.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Watch every moment unfold across </span></span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>our 10m video wall</span></span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>, surrounded by fellow fans and the energy that only a World Cup Final can deliver. Whether </span><span>you're</span><span> following your nation to glory or simply here for the spectacle, </span><span>it&rsquo;s</span><span> sure to be</span><span> an unforgettable evening from first whistle to final celebrations.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Arrive early and make the most of </span></span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Happy Hour from 6pm to 7pm</span></span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>, before the excitement builds towards kick-off. Your &pound;10 ticket includes a bottle of Budweiser&nbsp;on arrival, because a World Cup Final deserves a proper match-day welcome.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>A live DJ will set the tone before the game and keep the atmosphere going after the </span><span>match ends</span><span>, creating a night that goes beyond the football itself.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span>Grab your tickets so you </span><span>don&rsquo;t</span> <span>miss out on</span><span> great drinks, </span><span>good company </span><span>and </span><span>the </span><span>electric </span><span>atmosphere</span> <span>that makes the World Cup </span><span>Final </span><span>so special.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<h4><strong></strong><br /></h4>\n</div>\n<style>\na {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n</style>",
