    "event_title": "Little Ocean Makers - Pebble Painting ",
    "event_description": "<style>\na {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n</style>\n<div>\n<p>Join us at Riverside Market for a fun and creative pebble painting workshop by Kids Table.</p>\n<p>Little ones can let their imaginations run wild as they paint and decorate their own pebbles using a variety of colours and designs. It&rsquo;s a relaxed, hands-on activity that encourages creativity and self-expression, with each child taking home their own unique creation to keep or gift.</p>\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"519\"><strong>Free to attend</strong></p>\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span>Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.fulhampier.com/riverside-market\">Riverside Market</a><span>, from burgers, to Butter Chicken, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://brasserieconstance.com/\">Brasserie Constance</a><span>, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</span></p>\n</div>\n<p></p>",
