    "event_title": "Queerz Night: The Big Sports Quiz at Fulham Pier",
    "event_description": "<p></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\">\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">&nbsp;July is the month of sport. From the excitement of the FIFA World Cup to the drama of Wimbledon, the speed of Formula 1, the Tour de France and so much more, there's never been a better time to put your sporting knowledge to the test.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">Join us as <b>Queerz Night</b> brings London's boldest pub quiz experience to Fulham Pier for a special sports-themed edition.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">Created to bring the LGBTQ+ community and allies together, Queerz Night has grown from a small gathering into one of London's favourite quiz nights, welcoming hundreds of players every month.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">Expect a fast-paced evening packed with sporting trivia, playful competition, plenty of laughs and a warm, inclusive atmosphere where everyone is welcome whether you're a die-hard sports fanatic or just know enough to bluff your way through the final round.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\">Doors open at <b>7:00pm</b>, with the quiz kicking off at <b>7:30pm</b>. Gather your dream team, grab a drink and compete for fantastic quiz prizes.&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p class=\"yiv0054430423msonormal\" style=\"margin: 0cm;\"></p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in Riverside Market, from burgers, to Butter Chicken, Pizza to Cocktails. </span></div>\n<p><br /></p>",
