    "event_description": "<p data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"273\">Explore the Underwater Photographer of the Year digital exhibition, a striking collection of award winning images captured in UK waters. The exhibition reveals the diversity of life beneath the surface, from expansive wide-angle scenes to intricate macro detail.</p>\n<p data-start=\"275\" data-end=\"472\">The collection showcases the richness of Britain&rsquo;s marine environments; capturing unique wildlife, underwater landscapes and moments where human activity and nature intersect across the seabed. Providing a&nbsp;vivid insight into the hidden world of UK seas, highlighting both its beauty and complexity.</p>\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"753\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">This digital exhibition by the water creates a natural connection between the river above and the worlds below.</p>\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"753\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\">Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in Riverside Market, from burgers, to Lebanese, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</p>\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"753\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"570\" data-end=\"753\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span>Credit Name: Matty Smith/ UPY 2026</span></p>",
