    "event_title": "Jazz Box Summer Series Presents: Rozzzqween",
    "event_description": "<p><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Jazz Box</span></span></b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span> returns to Fulham Pier with an evening of live music led by one of the UK's most exciting emerging voices, </span></span><b><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>ROZZZQWEEN.</span></span></b><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Originally from Birmingham and now based in London, ROZZZQWEEN has built a growing reputation for her <strong>distinctive sound and effortlessly soulful vocals.</strong> Her delicately textured voice, combined with a genre-blending approach to<strong> jazz, soul and contemporary influences</strong>, has earned her recognition across streaming platforms and a rapidly expanding audience online.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Jazz Box offers the chance to experience exceptional live music up close. </span><span>Created for music lovers and the culturally curious, Jazz Box celebrates the joy of experiencing live performance up close. </span><span>Expect an evening filled with rich vocals, </span><span>an intimate live set</span> <span>and </span><span>an atmosphere that celebrates emerging talent</span><span>.&nbsp;</span><span>&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Whether </span><span>you're</span><span> a dedicated jazz enthusiast or simply looking for an unforgettable evening by the river, Jazz Box is a celebration of artistry, </span><span>connection</span><span> and the </span><span>power</span><span> of live performance.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Join us for a night of </span><span>good</span><span> music, great </span><span>vibes</span> <span>and the thrill of experiencing a rising star</span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Gather your friends and s</span><span>ecure your ticket</span><span>s</span><span> for an </span><span>exciting </span><span>evening with ROZZZQWEEN</span><span>.&nbsp;</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><br /></div>\n<p><strong>Timings:&nbsp;</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Doors Open - 7pm&nbsp;</strong><br /><strong>Show&nbsp;Time - 8pm</strong><br /></p>\n<p>Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in Riverside Market, from burgers, to Butter Chicken, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal, modern <strong>British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</strong></p>\n<p><br /></p>",
    "event_summary": "Step into the rhythm of Fulham Pier with Jazz Box our monthly celebration of the very best in modern and classic jazz. ",
