    "event_description": "<p>Uncover Hidden Histories at the Mudlark Exhibition!</p>\n<p><br />Step back in time and discover the secrets of the River Thames at the Mudlark Exhibition at Fulham Pier. This unique exhibition invites you into the world of Mudlarking, where forgotten artifacts emerge from the riverbanks to tell stories of London&rsquo;s layered past. Meet seasoned mudlarks, see incredible historical finds up close, and explore how the Thames has shaped the city through centuries.</p>\n<p>Whether you're a history lover, local explorer, or just curious to see what lies beneath the surface, this is a day not to be missed. Save the date and come see the Thames in a whole new light.</p>\n<p><strong>Free to Attend</strong></p>\n<p><span>Whilst you're here, why not join us for some food and drink? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in Riverside Market, from burgers, to Lebanese, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</span></p>",
