    "event_title": "Seaside Storytelling Adventure ",
    "event_description": "<p>Step into a seaside storytelling adventure with Bop Stars&rsquo; Imagination Station at Fulham Pier.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p>Led by professional performers from the West End and television, this immersive experience invites children to explore a world of storytelling, movement and make-believe. From sandy shores to ocean voyages, each moment is brought to life through interactive drama, music and creative play.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p>Children will sing, dance and discover, using fun and themed props woven into a playful narrative designed to build confidence, spark imagination and keep them fully engaged.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p>Magical yet relaxed, it&rsquo;s a high-quality, joyful experience where every child is encouraged to join in, express themselves and enjoy the adventure.<o:p></o:p></p>\n<p data-start=\"456\" data-end=\"519\"><strong>Please note that parents will have to stay with their child for the session and this workshop is for children aged 3-9years old.&nbsp;</strong><br /></p>\n<p data-start=\"521\" data-end=\"659\" data-is-last-node=\"\" data-is-only-node=\"\"><span>Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://www.fulhampier.com/riverside-market\">Riverside Market</a><span>, from burgers, to Butter Chicken, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at&nbsp;</span><a href=\"https://brasserieconstance.com/\">Brasserie Constance</a><span>, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</span></p>",
