    "event_title": "Comedy Box Summer Series presented by Camden Town Brewery ",
    "event_description": "<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\">\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span>This summer, laughter takes centre stage at Fulham Pier as <strong>Comedy Box returns</strong> for a special series presented by <strong>Camden Town Brewery,</strong> in partnership with our friends at <strong>Nice N' Spiky</strong>.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span>Expect an evening of <strong>standout stand-up, sharp </strong></span><strong>wit </strong><span><strong>and plenty of belly laughs</strong>, all set against the lively atmosphere of Fulham Pier. Featuring a line-up of brilliant comedians, Comedy Box is for anyone looking to switch off, settle in and enjoy a night of great entertainment in great company.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span>Arrive early and make the most of our <strong>pre-show Happy Hour at Orange Box, with 30% off</strong> wine and Camden Hells beer from 7pm to 8pm. </span><span>It's</span><span> the perfect excuse to gather friends, grab a drink and ease into the evening before the first act takes to the stage.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><strong><span data-contrast=\"none\">Throughout the night, guests will also have the chance to take part in a special competition with Camden Town Brewery. Complete the phrase on a postcard for the opportunity to win some extra special prizes.&nbsp;</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></strong></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\">Expect a buzzing crowd, plenty of laughs and a summer evening worth talking about long after the final punchline.</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"none\"><span>Gather your friends,</span><span> book your </span><span>tickets</span><span> and join us for a night of comedy by the river.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n</div>",
    "event_summary": "This summer laughter takes centre stage at Fulham Pier as Comedy Box returns for a special summer series presented by Camden Town Brewery. ",
