    "event_description": "<style>\na {\n    text-decoration: none;\n    color: #464feb;\n}\ntr th, tr td {\n    border: 1px solid #e6e6e6;\n}\ntr th {\n    background-color: #f5f5f5;\n}\n</style>\n<div>\n<p>Join us at Riverside Market for a fun and creative kite making workshop, where children can design and build their own colourful kite.</p>\n<p>This hands-on session encourages imagination and creativity as little ones decorate their kites using bright colours and playful patterns. Once complete, they&rsquo;ll be ready to take home - perfect for outdoor play and summer adventures.</p>\n<p>Session Times:</p>\n<p>11:30am-1:00pm</p>\n<p>1:30pm-3:00pm&nbsp;</p>\n</div>\n<p><span>Why not join us for some food and drink before or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in Riverside Market, from burgers, to Lebanese, Pizza to Cocktails. And if you&rsquo;re looking for something more refined, why not book a table at Brasserie Constance, our seasonal, modern British Brasserie by Adam Byatt.</span></p>\n<p><br /></p>",
