    "event_description": "<p><strong>Three months. Three moods. One unforgettable summer of cinema.</strong></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Sunset Stories takes you on a journey through iconic films and hidden gems. Each month reveals a new theme, with the film itself kept a secret until you arrive. From nostalgic classics to feel-good favourites and unexpected cult hits, every screening is part of a bigger story.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Start your evening with golden hour drinks by the river before stepping into Orange Box as the lights dim and the mystery begins.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Choose your experience:</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span><strong>&pound;5 ticket includes admission and popcorn</strong> for the perfect classic cinema night.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span><strong>&pound;10 ticket includes admission, popcorn and a specially curated cocktail</strong> designed to match the mood of the evening.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>With each month bringing a fresh vibe and a carefully curated atmosphere, this </span><span>isn&rsquo;t</span><span> just a film night, </span><span>it&rsquo;s</span><span> your summer ritual. Come curious, leave obsessed.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>\n<p><em><span data-contrast=\"auto\">Age restriction: 18+ only</span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></em></p>\n<p><span data-contrast=\"auto\"><span>Complete your cinema experience with food and drinks before or after the film. Riverside Market offers a variety of independent vendors, serving everything from burgers and tacos to pizza and cocktails.</span></span><span data-ccp-props=\"{}\">&nbsp;</span></p>",
