    "event_title": "Queerz Night",
    "event_description": "<p><span fontscheme=\"2\">Get ready for </span><strong fontscheme=\"2\">London&rsquo;s boldest pub quiz experience</strong><span fontscheme=\"2\"> as</span><strong fontscheme=\"2\"> Queerz Night </strong><span fontscheme=\"2\">brings its high-energy trivia night to Fulham Pier.</span></p>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Created to bring the LGBTQ+ community and allies together, Queerz Night has grown from a small gathering into one of London&rsquo;s most popular quiz nights, drawing hundreds of players every month. Expect a fast-paced evening packed with brilliant trivia, playful competition and a welcoming atmosphere where everyone can join in.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong><span fontscheme=\"2\"></span></strong><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong><span fontscheme=\"2\">Doors open at 7pm for a 7:30pm start. With lots of quiz prizes to be won...</span></strong></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><strong><span fontscheme=\"2\"></span></strong><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Whether you&rsquo;re a seasoned quiz champion or just in it for the fun, gather your team and get ready for a night of friendly competition, connection and seriously good entertainment.</span></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\" fontscheme-block=\"2\"><br /></div>\n<div class=\"ewa-rteLine\"><span fontscheme=\"2\">Why not join us for some food and drink before, during, or after? You&rsquo;ll find casual bites and drinks in Riverside Market, from burgers, to Butter Chicken, Pizza to Cocktails. </span></div>\n<p><br /></p>",
